Hello,

A quick mail to announce a new mirror for linux kernel sources. It is aimed at 
admin rather than developers (readonly) and 'lightweight' in the sense that 
the repository is a lot smaller.

We are few people actively using it, you can count on this being maintained.

The mirror is at

	https://bitbucket.org/orzel/linux-kernel-stable

and the following blog entry provides more information.

